{"src":"en","tgt":"hi","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":163000,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"hi","src":"en","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":7706.929075000001,"text":"If you have watched the movie National Treasure, you may think a treasure map was written on the back of the Declaration of Independence."},{"kind":"text","t":8735.549675999999,"text":"अगर आपने National Treasure फिल्म देखी है, तो आपको लग सकता है कि Declaration of Independence के पीछे एक खजाने का नक्शा लिखा था।"},{"kind":"audio","t":8860.047757,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":530,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":8864.731177,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":8869.707502,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":8874.840644,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":8879.966976,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":8885.250546,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1160},{"kind":"audio","t":8890.301958999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":8891.789694,"samples":22624,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":400},{"kind":"input","t":13877.279944,"text":"The hot chocolate is up to Belgian standards. Fruit juices are pricey, but after a while, you'll be able to taste the sweetness."},{"kind":"text","t":14717.430838,"text":"हॉट चॉकलेट बेल्जियम के मानकों के अनुरूप है। फ्रूट जूस महंगे होते हैं, लेकिन कुछ समय बाद, आप उनकी मिठास महसूस कर पाएंगे।"},{"kind":"audio","t":14837.600863,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":510,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14839.060738,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":14840.69698,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":80,"off":1280},{"kind":"audio","t":14842.336462,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1240},{"kind":"audio","t":14843.845045999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":150,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14845.294290999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14847.14644,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14847.436845,"samples":14824,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":80},{"kind":"input","t":22220.708834999998,"text":"However, that is not true. Although there is something written on the back of the document, it is not a treasure map."},{"kind":"text","t":23055.049118,"text":"हालाँकि, यह सच नहीं है। हालाँकि दस्तावेज़ के पीछे कुछ लिखा है, लेकिन वह कोई खजाने का नक्शा नहीं है।"},{"kind":"audio","t":23172.396921,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":510,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":23173.696959,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":23175.131864,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":23176.651498,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1090},{"kind":"audio","t":23178.025905,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":23179.681547,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1230},{"kind":"audio","t":23179.983830999998,"samples":9192,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":29990.050892,"text":"You may also wish to consult the advice of governments other than your own, but their advice is designed for their citizens."},{"kind":"text","t":31014.329487,"text":"आप अपनी सरकार के अलावा अन्य सरकारों की सलाह लेना भी चाह सकते हैं, लेकिन उनकी सलाह उनके अपने नागरिकों के लिए बनाई गई है।"},{"kind":"audio","t":31135.716352,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":520,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31140.891673,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31146.130014,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31151.430163,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31156.350659,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31161.464181,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31166.361928000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31168.614838999998,"samples":28624,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":680},{"kind":"input","t":41297.360485000005,"text":"Hong Kong Island gives the territory of Hong Kong its name and is a place that many tourists regard as the main focus."},{"kind":"text","t":42398.301975,"text":"हांगकांग द्वीप हांगकांग क्षेत्र को अपना नाम देता है और यह एक ऐसी जगह है जिसे कई पर्यटक मुख्य केंद्र मानते हैं।"},{"kind":"audio","t":42513.121028,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":520,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":42518.335189000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":42523.554811,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":180,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42528.716854000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42534.026575,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42539.218587,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42541.697275000006,"samples":26592,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":590},{"kind":"input","t":49090.231452,"text":"Anyone who's going to drive at hot latitudes or over mountain passes should consider the possibility of snow, ice, or free"},{"kind":"text","t":50366.500724000005,"text":"जो कोई भी गर्म अक्षांशों या पहाड़ी दर्रों पर गाड़ी चलाने जा रहा है, उसे बर्फ, पाले या ठंड की संभावना पर विचार करना चाहिए।"},{"kind":"audio","t":50485.94426800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":510,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50491.211919,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50496.502250000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50501.890049,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1160},{"kind":"audio","t":50507.12819,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":140,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50512.48019,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50517.828140000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50518.98758,"samples":21424,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":420},{"kind":"input","t":59042.521117000004,"text":"Segregation and recombination shuffle variation back and forth between the two pools."},{"kind":"text","t":60015.508066,"text":"पृथक्करण और पुनर्संयोजन दोनों पूल्स के बीच भिन्नता को आगे-पीछे बदलते रहते हैं।"},{"kind":"audio","t":60125.595628,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":510,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":60130.734422,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":90,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":60135.928504,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":60141.256104,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":60146.629443000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":60147.144625,"samples":14960,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":80},{"kind":"input","t":61184.480669000004,"text":"with each generation."},{"kind":"text","t":61435.090669000005,"text":"हर पीढ़ी के साथ।"},{"kind":"audio","t":61526.417438000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":460,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61528.402435,"samples":21832,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":520},{"kind":"input","t":66789.779083,"text":"The term bug is used by entomologists in a formal sense for this group of insects."},{"kind":"text","t":67840.397963,"text":"कीटविज्ञानी कीटों के इस समूह के लिए औपचारिक रूप से 'बग' (bug) शब्द का उपयोग करते हैं।"},{"kind":"audio","t":67950.79585,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":500,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67952.19099599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67953.625462,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67955.139917,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67956.72825999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67957.135973,"samples":15560,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":130},{"kind":"input","t":74687.045919,"text":"First, most riders wearing riding boots with a heel and a smooth, quite narrow sole."},{"kind":"text","t":75681.212691,"text":"सबसे पहले, अधिकांश सवार हील वाले और चिकने, काफी संकीर्ण सोल वाले राइडिंग बूट पहनते थे।"},{"kind":"audio","t":75793.28065,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":500,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":75798.431413,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":140,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":75803.697954,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":75808.91799599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":75814.050379,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":75818.187729,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":980},{"kind":"audio","t":75818.51523399999,"samples":3192,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":83902.453029,"text":"The commission was Martelli's response to widespread anti-regime protests that started in October."},{"kind":"text","t":84755.391105,"text":"यह आयोग अक्टूबर में शुरू हुए व्यापक शासन-विरोधी विरोध प्रदर्शनों पर मार्टेली की प्रतिक्रिया थी।"},{"kind":"audio","t":84866.915023,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":540,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84872.296082,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84877.471844,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84882.65293699999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84888.010257,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84892.501421,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1080},{"kind":"audio","t":84892.772956,"samples":5592,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":91128.29457499999,"text":"Fire rescue crews eventually doused the fire by 11.35pm."},{"kind":"text","t":92009.30243699999,"text":"अग्निशमन कर्मियों ने अंततः रात 11.35 बजे तक आग पर काबू पा लिया।"},{"kind":"audio","t":92120.81010599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":530,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92126.075397,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92131.20495,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1270},{"kind":"audio","t":92136.415312,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92139.240475,"samples":28528,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":650},{"kind":"input","t":97371.700271,"text":"The tensioning storm of the Atlantic hurricane season, Subtropic Storm Jerry,"},{"kind":"text","t":98291.015777,"text":"अटलांटिक हरिकेन सीजन का तनावपूर्ण तूफान, सबट्रॉपिक स्टॉर्म जेरी,"},{"kind":"audio","t":98463.385468,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":510,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98468.459852,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98473.688514,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98478.89994599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98479.24325,"samples":15328,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":120},{"kind":"input","t":100239.602202,"text":"formed in the Atlantic Ocean today."},{"kind":"text","t":100624.266191,"text":"आज अटलांटिक महासागर में बना।"},{"kind":"audio","t":100728.74227799999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":500,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":100733.745633,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":100735.483324,"samples":22664,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":430},{"kind":"input","t":107227.599663,"text":"It has brought us to train the car and many other transportation devices."},{"kind":"text","t":107933.654237,"text":"इसने हमें कार और कई अन्य परिवहन उपकरणों को प्रशिक्षित करने के लिए प्रेरित किया है।"},{"kind":"audio","t":108040.565433,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":510,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108042.27017399999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":108043.632181,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108045.17915499999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108046.708189,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1270},{"kind":"audio","t":108046.988245,"samples":10160,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":116608.53077,"text":"It's renowned for being an epicenter of luxury began in about 400 AD and lasted up a"},{"kind":"text","t":117946.180816,"text":"यह विलासिता के केंद्र के रूप में प्रसिद्ध है, जिसकी शुरुआत लगभग 400 ईस्वी में हुई थी और यह... तक चला।"},{"kind":"audio","t":118109.270263,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":540,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":118114.93545799999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":118120.081221,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":110,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":118125.41428099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":118130.78581999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":118134.32978999999,"samples":31760,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":800},{"kind":"audio","t":118245.983946,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":118246.33713999999,"samples":8632,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":120745.692081,"text":"until about 1100 A.D."},{"kind":"text","t":121208.017129,"text":"लगभग 1100 ईस्वी तक।"},{"kind":"audio","t":121301.119007,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":490,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":121306.993588,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":121308.09956999999,"samples":20264,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":420},{"kind":"input","t":127070.282597,"text":"The surface of the moon is made of rocks and dust. The outer layer of the moon is called the crust."},{"kind":"text","t":127596.653754,"text":"चंद्रमा की सतह चट्टानों और धूल से बनी है। चंद्रमा की बाहरी परत को क्रस्ट कहा जाता है।"},{"kind":"audio","t":127708.602435,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":530,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127713.60665999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127718.67000499999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1130},{"kind":"audio","t":127723.941366,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127729.114168,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127730.23257,"samples":20360,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":330},{"kind":"input","t":134485.202592,"text":"The U.S. Corps of Engineers estimated that six inches of rainfall could breach the previously damaged"},{"kind":"text","t":135555.250634,"text":"यू.एस. कोर ऑफ इंजीनियर्स ने अनुमान लगाया कि छह इंच की बारिश पहले से क्षतिग्रस्त हिस्से को तोड़ सकती है।"},{"kind":"audio","t":135661.464682,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":440,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":135661.824696,"samples":8032,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":135771.515124,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":510,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135776.652228,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135781.87425999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135787.325488,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135792.5392,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":135796.68129,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1000},{"kind":"audio","t":135796.936665,"samples":4392,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":141468.340364,"text":"In particular, it is claimed that one can detect whether a person is lying by interpreting micro-expressions correctly."},{"kind":"text","t":142983.657752,"text":"विशेष रूप से, यह दावा किया गया है कि सूक्ष्म-अभिव्यक्तियों (micro-expressions) की सही व्याख्या करके यह पता लगाया जा सकता है कि कोई व्यक्ति झूठ बोल रहा है या नहीं।"},{"kind":"audio","t":143131.462428,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":520,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":143132.956032,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":143134.29429,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":143135.862123,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":143137.309749,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":143138.967771,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":143140.502675,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":143141.98782,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":143143.526894,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":143143.816399,"samples":12288,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":147227.510003,"text":"Do not deface the site by marking or scratching graffiti into structure."},{"kind":"text","t":147910.340819,"text":"संरचना परgraffiti लिखकर या खुरचकर साइट को खराब न करें।"},{"kind":"audio","t":148017.94129299998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":490,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148023.085906,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1150},{"kind":"audio","t":148028.302948,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148033.055478,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1190},{"kind":"audio","t":148033.25852499998,"samples":7528,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":154878.182899,"text":"The tiger's roar is not like the full-voiced roar of a lion, but more like a sentence of snarly, shouted words."},{"kind":"text","t":156347.825288,"text":"बाघ की दहाड़ शेर की पूरी आवाज़ वाली दहाड़ जैसी नहीं होती, बल्कि गुर्राते हुए चिल्लाए गए शब्दों के एक वाक्य की तरह अधिक होती है।"},{"kind":"audio","t":156483.272692,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":510,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156488.418055,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156493.792094,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156499.50987799998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156504.236688,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156509.377701,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156514.78367,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156518.222192,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":990},{"kind":"audio","t":156518.486898,"samples":3656,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":161951.006548,"text":"20th century research has shown that there are two pools of genetic variation, hidden and expressed."},{"kind":"text","t":163016.276011,"text":"20वीं सदी के शोध ने दिखाया है कि आनुवंशिक भिन्नता के दो पूल होते हैं, छिपे हुए और व्यक्त।"},{"kind":"audio","t":163123.83400499998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":500,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163129.199355,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163135.064286,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163140.292828,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163145.23490399998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163147.553065,"samples":25760,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":580},{"kind":"close","t":173205.045985,"code":1005}]}